OL,3,GNEWSATravel disruption as 30k expected
OL,4,Ato take part in Cardiff Half Marathon
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are warnings of travel disruption
OL,7,Fand road closures as 30,000 runners are
OL,8,Fexpected to take part in the Cardiff
OL,9,FHalf Marathon on Sunday.
OL,11,FThe 23rd edition of the race will see
OL,12,Fparticipants run past landmarks
OL,13,Fincluding the Wales Millennium Centre
OL,14,Fand the Principality Stadium.
OL,16,FA variety of bands and choirs will
OL,17,Fperform along the course, providing
OL,18,Fentertainment for both runners and
OL,19,Fsupporters.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
